Welcome, I'm Author, a curious tinkerer who explores the digital landscape.
I'm interested in Linux, technology, and various technical experiments.
Here you can find technical content and observations.

- Practical Linux guides and dotfiles.
- Tauri and AppImage troubleshooting.
- Container and bootc experiments.
- Cloudflare deployment notes.

Enjoy exploring the content and feel free to reach out!

